\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S Party Chat - Jade\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Jade\cell I left you once, <pc>, and I swear I will never do that again. I owe it to Lady Eleanor.\par
\par
Now, come. We must rejoin Rab and the others before Hendrik and his men find us. Let's head back to the ruins of Dundrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We seem to have given them the slip\emdash but we were very fortunate. If Hendrik hadn't faltered, we'd have been done for...\par
\par
Well, let's not dwell on that. We must return to Dundrasil and rejoin the others.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1210\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell For years Rab and I have been trying to uncover the truth about the evil that dwells in Heliodor...\par
\par
But all we have succeeded in learning is a name: Mordegon...\par
\par
We feared we had reached a dead end, but things have changed. With you alongside us, we may yet rid Heliodor of the shadow that has fallen upon it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell That vision the Rainbough gave us was incredible... There's no doubt about it\emdash you really are the Luminary.\par
\par
Rab and I have spent so many years wandering around, getting nowhere. If only we'd have found you sooner...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I can't believe I allowed us to be spotted! How could I have been so careless!? Reinforcements will already be on the way, I'm certain of it...\par
\par
Come on, <pc>! We must hurry up and rejoin the others!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We must get away from here, before reinforcements arrive!\par
\par
Come on, <pc>! Let's return to the altar and join Rab and the others!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1210\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Every time I see the sea, it reminds me of what happened all those years ago in Dundrasil.\par
\par
Rab and I fled and boarded a ship, setting sail before dawn.\par
\par
I still remember the inky black water. I was terrified, but Rab put his arm round my shoulder and told me it was going to be alright. I will never forget that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Rab really is very popular. At first I didn't believe him when he said he had friends all over the world, but it's true.\par
\par
And they weren't all elderly gentlemen, either. Rab gets along with everyone\emdash princesses and paupers, young and old. No, there can't be many royals like him...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Once the sea gates have been opened, we can take to the high seas. Who knows what awaits us there...\par
\par
But first things first, we need to board our ship and return to Puerto Valor. Servantes should open the gates for us once we are ready.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Is there something else we need to do here, <pc>? I know it's very pleasant, but this isn't the time to dawdle...\par
\par
The gates are open, and the ocean awaits. Let's go and see what new things we can find out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I do understand, <pc>. Sometimes all you want to do is forget about the world's troubles and have some fun...\par
\par
Well, I suppose I can't stop you. Please don't overdo it, though. I may not know much about casinos, but I know that moderation is the key...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I would never have expected you to be quite such a fan of casinos, <pc>. Still, I don't suppose anything I say will persuade you to leave. I'll just have to wait until you get bored...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell If the Rainbough hadn't shown us that vision, we'd have no idea how to get to Yggdrasil.\par
\par
To think, when we first laid eyes on it back in Octagonia, we had no idea of the power the Rainbough possessed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Rab and I spent so long trying to find out more about Mordegon, but we just kept hitting a brick wall...\par
\par
But now we've met you, there's hope again. I'm starting to believe we can finish this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell ......\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The girl you told us about\emdash Dora, was it?\emdash I saw her walking towards the ruins.\par
\par
I expect it's not sightseeing that's drawing her there\emdash just what is it about that place?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell You know that little girl you told us about? Do you think she might still be searching for her parents?\par
\par
I know we must push on, but I really don't think we can leave until we have made sure she is alright.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The people trapped inside that mural are in desperate need of our help.\par
\par
I know it's a dreadful place, but as long as we are together, we have nothing to fear. Come on, <pc>\emdash we have to go back.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Did you notice that the mural had a crack, just like the one on the Other Side?\par
\par
It's hard to believe, I know, but I think we may have been inside the mural...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I wasn't totally unprepared for it, but it was still a shock to see that little girl suddenly turn into that evil creature...\par
\par
I can't help thinking of my poor father. Mordegon seems to have deceived him. He seems to have deceived everyone in Heliodor...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Many centuries ago, Phnom Nonh was at the heart of a flourishing civilisation. Then Mordegon possessed its chancellor, and reduced it to ruins...\par
\par
I fear that something similar is now taking place in Heliodor.\par
\par
After all, Mordegon is already making his presence felt in the kingdom. Who knows what he may be plotting...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Ever since we came in here, I feel as if we're being watched. Can you sense it too? It's as if some evil presence is following our every move...\par
\par
I fear for that poor girl. It can't be safe for her to be here alone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell That woman in the picture, it's strange, but she seemed to be especially fond of you, <pc>...\par
\par
Oh, and you know what else is strange? I've started to feel as though we're being watched again. Ever since that woman in the painting went away, in fact...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell This is not going to end here. I won't let it. Now come on, <pc>. Let's find a way out\emdash we're not going to let some wretched curse stand in our way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell You saved us, <pc>... Thank you.\par
\par
There is evil in this place that must be confronted, but for now I think it's best for us to find a way out of here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Mordegon... I suspect he's the one who's behind all of this... Behind everything that's happened in Heliodor...\par
\par
We have a lot to think about, but for now we'd better return to the village. Oh, and let's not forget that we have the magic key now. That was an unexpected bonus.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Rab and I have visited Phnom Nonh once before...\par
\par
We didn't find out anything useful back then, but this time we've got you with us, <pc>...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell L'Acad\f0\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles... My mother told me about this place.\par
\par
It's one of the finest schools in Erdrea. All sorts of rich folks send their girls here to learn how to be perfect little ladies...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We should look out for columns of light when we're out at sea\f1\emdash\f0 they're a sign that we can use Lorelei's harp, apparently.\par
\par
It seems there are places we can go that no ship could ever reach...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Did Sniflheim get hit by an ice storm? Is that why everything's frozen?\par
\par
I don't know much about cold climates, but this seems too extreme to just be down to bad weather. There must be some other explanation...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We'll freeze to death if we stay out here much longer. If we can't get in through the gate, we'll need to find another way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell (gulp) That was a long voyage... I hope no one's feeling...seasick...\par
\par
Maybe we should find an inn and take a rest, <pc>? We shouldn't try and do too much. Someone might...(gulp)...you know...someone might be feeling a little...(gulp)...unwell...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell This wind chills you to the bone... I knew it was going to be cold up here, but I wasn't prepared for this...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The Eerie Eyrie... What an impressive name! And fitting, too...\par
\par
Birds are very important to us Heliodorians. We have a two-headed eagle on our royal crest, after all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Once all this is over, I would really like to have a proper conversation with Queen Marina.\par
\par
Truly, she seems like a natural leader, someone who was born to rule. I would love to hear more about her experiences as Queen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell So this is where Michelle comes from. Well, it's certainly very different to life on dry land!\par
\par
I'd love to take a look around, but we should speak to the Queen first. We need to tell her about Michelle and Kainui.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell ......\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Hmm... I can't see anyone around here who fits Michelle's description of her fianc\'e9. She did say Kai was a fisherman from this village though, didn't she?\par
\par
Well, I suppose there's nothing else for it\f1\emdash\f0 we'll just have to ask around. Surely somebody in the village must know where we can find him. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Well, that explains it. The reason Kai couldn't go to meet Michelle was because he had to fight the giant squid and save his village.\par
\par
No wonder she's got such a soft spot for him\f1\emdash\f0 he's quite the hero. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Why isn't Kai celebrating the defeat of the demon squid with everyone else?\par
\par
I don't mean to speak badly of him, but it would seem he's not the most fun-loving fellow... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell That story was true. All those terrible things really happened to Kai's grandfather. I can hardly believe it.\par
\par
In fact, I don't believe it at all! The Michelle we met would never steal anyone's soul!\par
\par
Still, I don't suppose there's anything we can do about that now. Let's go and see what Kai has to show us. He said we should meet him on Saikiki Beach, on the other side of the church. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Let's go back to the Strand, <pc>. We need to give that veil to Michelle.\par
\par
The luau's over and the fishermen are making themselves ready to set sail again. We should do the same. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Come on, <pc>. Let's take Kai over to Saikiki Beach. Michelle has waited long enough already. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I never knew that mermaids lived for five hundred years. The flow of time must feel so much slower to them than it does to us.\par
\par
That didn't make any difference in the end, though... Michelle couldn't bear to spend another second in a world without Kainoa. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell When you've finished sightseeing, let's head down to the kingdom of the mermaids, shall we? We have to tell the Queen what happened to Michelle.\par
\par
The whirlpool that leads to Nautica is in the middle of the inland sea. We just need to sail through the Valorian strait and play Lorelei's harp once we're in the right spot. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Queen Marina said she would pray that Michelle and Kainoa would meet again in their next lives, and I'm going to do the same.\par
\par
It was the World Tree's will that brought them together. I'm sure that one day their spirits will meet again, and then they'll never be apart. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell So this is Saikiki Beach, the place that Kai's grandfather was exiled to. I wonder what it is that he wants to show us? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell What a lonely place Saikiki Beach is... I can't begin to imagine how Kainoa must have felt, living alone in that cabin for all those years. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Michelle's waiting for us behind that rock. Let's take Kai to meet her. She's been waiting long enough. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Kai seemed pretty upset back there. I know he's not the friendliest person, but I think he probably needs some company right now.\par
\par
Let's check on him before we head back to the village. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The mermaid in Kainoa's painting looked just like Michelle... He only knew her for a short time, but he never forgot her face... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I wonder why Kainoa never went to meet Michelle? Surely he could have built a new boat and slipped away when no one was looking?\par
\par
Instead, he died on this lonely shore, without ever telling anyone what really happened. I'm sure he must have had a very good reason... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Come on, <pc>. Let's go and find Kai and bring him back to Michelle.\par
\par
She said she marked his village on your map, didn't she? Once we're at sea we can get our bearings and set sail for Lonalulu. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Does Michelle know the kind of stories they're telling about her kind back in Lonalulu, do you think?\par
\par
If I found out that my fianc\'e9's friends and relations were spreading malicious rumours about me, I don't know what I'd do... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I know it's hard, but we have to give Michelle the veil and tell her why her fianc\'e9 isn't with us.\par
\par
We have to see this through to the bitter end... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The jetty where we usually land is far too exposed\f1\emdash\f0 Michelle would be spotted right away.\par
\par
We should sail around the cape and ask her to wait for us by Saikiki Beach. Nobody ever goes there\f1\emdash\f0 it's the perfect place for a secret rendezvous. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I know it's too late to change anything now, but I wish Michelle hadn't chosen to end it all.\par
\par
Losing people that you love is sad, but it is simply a part of life. So long as one is alive, one can dream of a better tomorrow.\par
\par
That's what I believe, at least... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell You did the right thing, <pc>. You can't live without hope. Even if that hope is just an illusion... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell When we meet the queen of the mermaids, we should ask her about the Orb\f1\emdash\f0 but there's something more important we have to tell her first.\par
\par
We have to tell her that Michelle won't be coming back... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Well, here we are. Nautica, Michelle's hometown... You can't see it at all from the surface, but it's so beautiful up close.\par
\par
Still, we can leave the sightseeing till later. First we have to speak with the Queen, and tell her what happened with Michelle and Kai... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell When our adventure is over, I'd like to come back here and have a good, long chat with Queen Marina.\par
\par
She was born a princess, too. I'm sure she'd be able to give me some excellent advice about how best to rule my country when the time comes. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Michelle has marked Lonalulu on the map for us so we won't get lost.\par
\par
Come on <pc>, let's go and find Kai and bring those lovebirds back together! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell This might be the last time we ever set foot on the Strand. Now that Michelle is gone, we have no reason to go there again. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
