\par
...Ah, but that's all in the past. Now that I've found you, I'll never be lonely again. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell It looks like we can't get in through the main gates, but we'll freeze if we stay out here. Let's see if we can find another way into the city. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
