\pard\intbl Jade\cell You're certainly stronger than you were at the Masked Martial Arts tournament. I do wonder who would win if we fought each other now...?\par
\par
I don't really, of course. It'd be another foregone conclusion... On a more serious note, why don't we go up to the tor's peak? We've already come this far, after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I finally made it! I've finally come home!\par
\par
I'd better not start feeling too nostalgic, though. That can wait. For now, we have things to do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell It's been tough, but those long years I spent exiled from Heliodor have taught me a lot.\par
\par
I've learned what's important in life. Of course, I treasure my father, my kingdom and my companions. But more than that, I treasure every living thing in Erdrea.\par
\par
I will fight for them all. When we take on Calasmos, we will be fighting for the future of our entire world and everyone in it. And we will win.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Come on, let's go and tell my father what we've discovered. He'll be desperate to learn more of this dark star's true nature.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I have fond memories of growing up with Hendrik and Jasper as playmates.\par
\par
They could be tough with me and would sometimes tease me, but I knew they cared for me like a sister.\par
\par
Seeing Jasper's smiling face reminded me of that time. I believe that at the end, he had finally returned to his old self\f1\emdash\f0 the Jasper I used to know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The dark power that Jasper wields may be formidable, but Hendrik is never going to admit defeat. We must allow him to take up the gauntlet once more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I remember the day when everything changed. When I fled Dundrasil Castle and left Hendrik and Jasper behind, I felt like I was losing two brothers...\par
\par
Sometimes I wonder if it wouldn't have been better to stay\f1\emdash\f0 maybe I could have done something to stop all this happening.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell There's no doubt about it. The vision the Yggdrasil root showed us was the throne room of Heliodor Castle. It may have lain in ruins, but I know my home when I see it.\par
\par
Don't ask me why, but I get the strong feeling that apparition has some connection with Heliodor Castle\f1\emdash\f0 and with Hendrik...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell As a child, I rarely strayed from the castle, and I wasn't even aware that places like this existed...\par
\par
The riches of Heliodor have certainly not been shared with those who live here. This is an injustice I must seek to rectify.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell When I first came here with Rab, I couldn't get him out of the bathhouse.\par
\par
In the end I had to threaten him with a roundhouse kick to get him to put some clothes on so that we could hit the road.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell What do you think really freed Ryu from the dragon's curse?\par
\par
Personally, I don't think it was the Seeing Glass, or anything we did. I think it was love.\par
\par
If it wasn't for Miko's love for her son, I feel certain that Ryu would have been done for long before we could bring that mirror to them. Without love, all hope would have been lost.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell This terrible feeling of dread that's hanging in the air must be coming from the star.\par
\par
It's making the monsters even more aggressive. We need to watch our step.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell There are people here who might like to flee, but who can't go and start new lives somewhere else just like that.\par
\par
They are fearful for the future but they have no choice but to go on. We must stand by them and banish evil from the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We managed to save this town, but I fear there are still countless monsters out there in the world.\par
\par
If we come across anyone else facing a similar threat, we must do all that is in our power to help them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Monsters have always posed a threat, but they've never been as brazen as this. This is a full-blown invasion!\par
\par
The dark star must be to blame. The evil that's emanating from it seems to have fired the monsters up...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I still can't quite believe Arachtagon returned and was controlling the fighters. He really was a nasty piece of work.\par
\par
Still, at least we've taken care of him for good now. Let's get back to what we were doing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell It's strange. There's no sign of Vince or any of the other competitors from the Masked Martial Arts contest.\par
\par
I can't escape the feeling that there's something very wrong here\f1\emdash\f0 we need to get to the bottom of this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Being in Zwaardsrust makes me think of what happened all those years ago in Dundrasil.\par
\par
Rab and I fled here and boarded a ship, setting sail before dawn.\par
\par
I still remember the inky black sea. I was terrified, but Rab put his arm round my shoulder and told me it was going to be alright. I will never forget that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell To think, the armour that once belonged to Drustan may still be here, buried somewhere deep underground.\par
\par
Any weapon or armour that was used by the heroes of legend is sure to be of great assistance in our battle against the Dark One...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Queen Eleanor continues to watch over and protect her husband...\par
\par
They still love each other deeply, just as they did when they were alive. Truly, they are an example to us all. I will hold them both close to my heart for as long as I live.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I remember that night we fled Dundrasil. We took a secret passage that went under the castle...\par
\par
I wish I could remember precisely where it was, but it's all a bit of a blur.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I remember this place. I escaped through these tunnels on the night Dundrasil was attacked...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell You know, I think I might like to spend a little time here once our journey is at an end.\par
\par
Just imagine swimming in the ocean before enjoying a fine meal, or watching a show in the evening as you listen to the sound of the waves lapping on the shore.\par
\par
Hee hee! Just thinking about it has put a spring in my step! And now I've imagined it, I'm going to do all I can to make it a reality!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Don Rodrigo is a classic old-fashioned knight, but you could tell how happy he was to see his son again, even if he did try to hide it.\par
\par
It was so nice to witness their reunion, all those years spent apart just falling away. I sincerely hope that the same thing can happen with my father...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Well, this clears things up. If Sylvando is from Puerto Valor, it makes sense that he would have encountered Hendrik. The place has always had strong links with Heliodor.\par
\par
And to think that Don Rodrigo is his father... I hope the two of them can resolve their differences. They could teach us a lot, I'm sure of it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Sylvando and Hendrik make quite a pair! It was amazing to see them, perfectly in synch. Well, I suppose they did train together all those years ago.\par
\par
Now, I don't know about you, <pc>, but I'm not going to let them have all the fun! Let's team up and learn all the new tricks we can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I have known about the Kingsbarrow since I was a girl, but I had no idea that knights used it for their training.\par
\par
It seems that only those in the know can train here\f1\emdash\f0 it's sealed off from prying eyes. I suppose it's an honour to have it opened for us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Once when Rab and I visited a casino, I was asked if I'd like to work there.\par
\par
Naturally, I refused, but who knows what the future holds? Once our journey comes to an end, maybe I'll see if they're still interested...\par
\par
...That was a joke! Just a joke!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I wonder what Kainui is doing now... I know he had a lot to deal with, but I hope he overcame everything and is living a happy life as a fisherman.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I'm so glad Kainui and Michelle are doing well. He did so much for her, it's nice to see that it's all worked out.\par
\par
It's sad that Kainoa is gone, of course, but Michelle and Kainui will just have to get on with their lives now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Look! Kainui and Michelle are in danger! We have to do something!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I wonder how Michelle is doing, still waiting for Kai to come...\par
\par
She had a tough time of it. Love between human and mermaid can't be easy. I mean, how do you plan a future together when time flows differently for the two of you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell It wasn't all combat training when Rab and I were travelling the world together. No, we did plenty of dancing too.\par
\par
In fact, travelling in the guise of a dancer can be really good when you're trying to keep a low profile. And it was a lot of fun too! Ah, I miss those days...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We don't really have time to spare, but it feels wrong to abandon these people to their fate.\par
\par
You will have to make a decision, <pc>. Do we stay here, or do we press on?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell That grey gordon may have been rather eccentric, but he was still a formidable opponent.\par
\par
Could he have been inspired by the dark star? I fear that its baneful influence has spread across the whole world...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Someone's making an awful lot of noise, <pc>... We should go and see what's happening.\par
\par
It might explain why the villagers are being made to dance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I'm getting used to the cold, but we still need to be careful. We don't want to end up with frostbite.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Snorri was conducting research into J\'f6rmun, it seems...\par
\par
If only we'd known. I feel terrible. We'll have to do something to make up for what we did, <pc>...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell What's that? You're wondering if I'm feeling the cold?\par
\par
Oh, don't worry about me! Rab and I have done a lot of training in extreme conditions over the years. A little nip in the air doesn't bother me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell When you flick through a book, it's easy to forget how much effort has gone into writing it.\par
\par
It's amazing to think that someone has put their heart and soul into every single book in this library!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I always thought Erik was a bit too nice to be a thief. Now I know where he gets his caring side\f1\emdash\f0 from looking out for Mia as they were growing up.\par
\par
I always wished I could have had a brother or sister. They teach you things you can't learn as an only child...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell There's something about the wind here, isn't there? It really cuts through you, chills you to the bone...\par
\par
It doesn't seem to bother Erik, though. Did you notice that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The four pictures in the main hall depict the battle between the heroes of legend and the Dark One.\par
\par
You know, there's something about those images that really gets my pulse racing. To think that we're following in their footsteps. It really is an honour.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell So Grand Master Pang plans to summon a stream of enemies for us to fight. It sounds like she's really going to push us to the limit.\par
\par
