\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Rab told me that those who come here to train are focused on bringing out their inner strength, and will undergo any hardship to achieve that goal.\par
\par
It sounds like something I might be interested in experiencing myself one day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Um, is there a reason you dragged us all the way up here?\par
\par
