\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Now that Bathysfear's gone, the Pearl of Wisdom is back in its rightful place. That must be a relief for the merfolk.\par
\par
They do have other problems to contend with, though. The dark star's getting monsters riled up all the way down here, too. We really need to do something about it, <pc>...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell It seems that no one is safe from the evil of the dark star\f1\emdash\f0 not even down here.\par
\par
We have to speak with Queen Marina and find out what exactly is going on.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell If you think about it, we've really been all over the world, from the bottom of the ocean to a village floating in the sky.\par
\par
