\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The sword we forged together is surely the equal of the one Erdwin once wielded.\par
\par
With both Swords of Light, the Dark One doesn't stand a chance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell There's something about the design of the Crucible, something that really draws you in...\par
\par
And you know the strangest thing? It feels familiar somehow...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Miko spoke of something called the Crucible sleeping in the volcano's heart.\par
\par
