\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I've heard a few people talk about the sacred being who practises the ancient art of puff-puff on a floating island...\par
\par
Not the best place for passing trade, I'd imagine...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We need to be careful, <pc>. This heat will sap our energy. We shouldn't stay here too long.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell This place seems to go on forever. I've completely lost track of how far we've come.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The monsters down here are a lot tougher than those on the surface.\par
\par
We can't afford to let our guard down. Not even for a second.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell So the Watchers must have been here from the beginning.\par
\par
I can't imagine staying put in this tiny village for however many years it's been, but then maybe they don't think like me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Where do you think the village's supplies of food and drink come from, <pc>?\par
\par
I suspect we'll just have to chalk that up as another mystery that'll probably never be solved.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
