\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell We can't give up now, <pc>.\par
\par
We're nearly there. The end is in sight, I just know it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
